@MarketWorkplace.Api http://localhost:5240

### Get the full dashboard payload (metrics, trend, categories, recent orders)
GET {{MarketWorkplace.Api}}/api/dashboard

### Revenue trend only
GET {{MarketWorkplace.Api}}/api/dashboard/revenue-trend

### List all products
GET {{MarketWorkplace.Api}}/api/products

### Search products
GET {{MarketWorkplace.Api}}/api/products?search=audio

### Distinct categories
GET {{MarketWorkplace.Api}}/api/products/categories

### Create a product
POST {{MarketWorkplace.Api}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Sample Widget",
  "sku": "SMP-0001",
  "category": "Accessories",
  "price": 24.99,
  "stock": 50
}

### Update a product
PUT {{MarketWorkplace.Api}}/api/products/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Aurora Wireless Headset (2nd gen)",
  "sku": "AUR-1001",
  "category": "Audio",
  "price": 159.00,
  "stock": 90
}

### Delete a product
DELETE {{MarketWorkplace.Api}}/api/products/1
